            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- A session that moved into a worktree (for example after Claude ran EnterWorktree) now opens with its history on another Mac, on the phone, and when Canopy restores it after a restart. Before, it opened as an empty new conversation and showed only messages sent after it was opened.
]]></description>
