        <item>
            <title>3.0.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 13:52:37 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>148</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Canopy reopens from the Dock or Finder after you quit it. In 3.0.x, the session service's "Running in Background" Dock tile captured the click, so nothing opened until that tile was quit too, which stopped every session.
- Sparkle updates no longer quit the session service. Updates also no longer sometimes fail to relaunch Canopy afterwards.
- The session service is started and kept running by the system's LaunchAgent. In 3.0.x it could end up running unmanaged and then skip its own restart after an update.

### Note
- The update to this version still restarts the session service once, so open sessions reconnect after it. Later updates restart the service without that interruption.
]]></description>
